# UI Primitives (CRITICAL)


This project has **53 reusable UI components** in `src/components/ui/`. You MUST use these before creating new ones.

## How It Works

1. When asked to implement UI → scan the Component Registry below
2. If a matching primitive exists → use it with `import { X } from '@/components/ui/<name>'`
3. If NO match found → ask user confirmation before creating a new component
4. NEVER use raw HTML elements when a primitive exists

