| sidebar panel | `Sheet` |
| loading | `Spinner` or `Skeleton` |
| date picker | `Calendar` |
| search, command palette | `Command` |
| tag, chip, pill | `Badge` |
| divider | `Separator` |
| slider, range | `Slider` |
| toggle switch | `Switch` |
| radio | `RadioGroup` |
| OTP, verification code | `InputOTP` |
| toolbar | `ToggleGroup` |

## Raw HTML Substitutions

NEVER use these raw HTML elements when the primitive exists:

| Raw HTML | Use Instead |
|----------|------------|
| `<button>` | `Button` from `@/components/ui/button` |
| `<input>` | `Input` from `@/components/ui/input` |
| `<textarea>` | `Textarea` from `@/components/ui/textarea` |
| `<select>` | `Select` from `@/components/ui/select` |
| `<table>` | `Table` + sub-components from `@/components/ui/table` |
| `<dialog>` | `Dialog` from `@/components/ui/dialog` |
| `<label>` | `Label` from `@/components/ui/label` |
| `<progress>` | `Progress` from `@/components/ui/progress` |

